    "short_description": "Securitas France, a subsidiary of the Swedish group Securitas AB, is a leading provider of private security services in France and internationally. Established in 1992, the company is headquartered in Issy-les-Moulineaux and employs around 17,000 people in France, contributing to a global workforce of over 340,000. Securitas France combines human expertise with technology to deliver high-value security solutions.\n\nThe company offers a comprehensive range of integrated security services tailored for businesses of all sizes and sectors. These include physical security services such as guarding and mobile security, electronic security systems, remote monitoring and alarm response, risk management consulting, and training programs. Securitas France is particularly recognized for its strong presence in the energy sector, serving a diverse clientele across 44 international markets.",
